# Java Record Layout and Schema

`public record` DTO/응답 타입은 **메서드 시그니처 한 줄 규칙(`java-method-layout.mdc`) 대상이 아니다.** record는 아래 레이아웃을 따른다.

## Record header

- Keep the existing multi-line record form: `public record Name(` … `) {`.
- Put `) {` on its own line after the last component.
- First line of every **new** record source file: one-line Korean role comment (`// …`).

## Between components

- Separate **every** record component with **two blank lines** (two line breaks between fields).
- The last component has **no trailing comma** before `)`.

## @Schema on each component

- Add `io.swagger.v3.oas.annotations.media.Schema` **directly above** each component.
- `description`: Korean field name / meaning (UI·DB 용어와 맞출 것).
- `example`: Thymeleaf·폼·API 문서에 쓸 **템플릿 값** (문자열 리터럴).
- Other parameter annotations (e.g. `@DateTimeFormat`, `@Valid`) stay on the component; place `@Schema` immediately above the type line (after other annotations if present).

```java
public record COAdminLoginRequestDto(

        @Schema(description = "로그인 아이디", example = "admin")
        String loginId,


        @Schema(description = "비밀번호", example = "password")
        String password
) {
}
```

## Examples by type

| Type | example guidance |
|------|------------------|
| `String` | realistic sample text |
| `Long` / `Integer` | `"1"` |
| `long` / `int` | numeric literal in `example` |
| `boolean` | `"true"` or `"false"` |
| `LocalDate` | `"2026-05-29"` |
| `LocalDateTime` | `"2026-05-29T10:00:00"` |
| `List<…>` | `"[]"` or short JSON array string |
| nested record/DTO | short descriptive string, e.g. `"검색 조건"` |

## Imports

- `import io.swagger.v3.oas.annotations.media.Schema;` when any component uses `@Schema`.

## Do not

- Collapse record components onto one line for “method signature” formatting.
- Omit `@Schema` on new record components.
